{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OniKiri is a fast-paced, first-person hack-and-slash game where you explore ancient ruins, battle mysterious creatures, and collect powerful blessings to survive. Slide, maneuver, and conquer your enemies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultimate and special abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OniKiri offers an ability-based combat experience. Find Ability Scrolls to unlock abilities like Bleed, Haste, or Health steal, enhancing your powers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/extras/0dfe76b3459f7610cb2713fa252a6087.poster.avif?t=1773167076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/extras/0dfe76b3459f7610cb2713fa252a6087.webm?t=1773167076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/extras/0dfe76b3459f7610cb2713fa252a6087.mp4?t=1773167076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wall running, sliding, dashing, climbing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/extras/75f22d27707e1d4217768dd214e842b9.poster.avif?t=1773167076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/extras/75f22d27707e1d4217768dd214e842b9.webm?t=1773167076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/extras/75f22d27707e1d4217768dd214e842b9.mp4?t=1773167076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-Ups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranging from common to heroic, enhance your strengths and weaknesses. You can create unique runs and builds with custom-made power-ups or by using fully randomized options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/extras/e4a324996e8aa587f6160f3b01d13d55.poster.avif?t=1773167076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/extras/e4a324996e8aa587f6160f3b01d13d55.webm?t=1773167076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/extras/e4a324996e8aa587f6160f3b01d13d55.mp4?t=1773167076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon skins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy showcasing your collection of weapon skins? By defeating enemies, you earn coins to buy your favorite skins. Customize your Katana, Kunai, short sword, or sheath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/extras/d095e7fbf82273926e0db611184dab47.poster.avif?t=1773167076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/extras/d095e7fbf82273926e0db611184dab47.webm?t=1773167076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/extras/d095e7fbf82273926e0db611184dab47.mp4?t=1773167076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3329210?t=1773167076","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3329210?t=1773167076","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329210/a0c2d252e093a982558ac89a19779e4c85089a6c/capsule_231x8